-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח ב'3: the work-week tables of a teacher
-- entitled to the full reduction of hours for age, in the reform's part
-- application in תשע"ד (§26(ד) sends to it): one from 50 to 55, one over
-- 55; the 60-minute hour of their presence; their notes on frontal hours
-- that are not whole and on too few.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`

§ `נספח ב'3`

-- The title ("טבלאות שבוע עבודה למורים הזכאים להפחתת שעות בשל גיל ביישום
-- חלקי של הרפורמה בשנת הלימודים תשע"ד"), the caption "מורה מגיל 50 ועד גיל
-- 55" and its table: from the full position less the age reduction —
-- §26(א)'s week for תשע"ד with 2 frontal hours off, 22 frontal, 5
-- individual and 7 teaching-support hours — down to 4 frontal hours, a
-- frontal hour less a column.
@ref akn:att_8__hc_1/p1 akn:att_8__hc_1/p2 akn:att_8__hc_1/t1
`the table of annex ב'3 from 50 to 55` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח ב'3"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band from 50 to 55`
        `what it is for`         IS `the week by the position`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 22 5 7 34,
            `an Oz annexed column` (95.59%) 21 5 6.5 32.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (91.18%) 20 4.5 6.5 31,
            `an Oz annexed column` (85.29%) 19 4 6 29,
            `an Oz annexed column` (82.35%) 18 4 6 28,
            `an Oz annexed column` (76.47%) 17 3.5 5.5 26,
            `an Oz annexed column` (73.53%) 16 3.5 5.5 25,
            `an Oz annexed column` (69.12%) 15 3.5 5 23.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (64.71%) 14 3 5 22,
            `an Oz annexed column` (58.82%) 13 3 4 20,
            `an Oz annexed column` (52.94%) 12 2.5 3.5 18,
            `an Oz annexed column` (50.00%) 11 2.5 3.5 17,
            `an Oz annexed column` (45.59%) 10 2.5 3 15.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (41.18%) 9 2 3 14,
            `an Oz annexed column` (35.29%) 8 1.5 2.5 12,
            `an Oz annexed column` (30.88%) 7 1.5 2 10.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (25.00%) 6 1 1.5 8.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (22.06%) 5 1 1.5 7.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (19.12%) 4 1 1.5 6.5

-- "מורה מעל גיל 55" and its table: §26(א)'s week for תשע"ד with 4 frontal
-- hours off, 20 frontal, 6 individual and 7 teaching-support hours, down to
-- 4.
@ref akn:att_8__hc_1/p4 akn:att_8__hc_1/t2
`the table of annex ב'3 over 55` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח ב'3"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band over 55`
        `what it is for`         IS `the week by the position`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 20 6 7 32,
            `an Oz annexed column` (95.31%) 19 5 6.5 30.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (90.63%) 18 4.5 6.5 29,
            `an Oz annexed column` (84.38%) 17 4 6 27,
            `an Oz annexed column` (79.69%) 16 4 5.5 25.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (75.00%) 15 3.5 5.5 24,
            `an Oz annexed column` (70.31%) 14 3.5 5 22.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (65.63%) 13 3 5 21,
            `an Oz annexed column` (59.38%) 12 3 4 19,
            `an Oz annexed column` (54.69%) 11 2.5 4 17.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (50.00%) 10 2.5 3.5 16,
            `an Oz annexed column` (45.31%) 9 2.5 3 14.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (40.63%) 8 2 3 13,
            `an Oz annexed column` (34.38%) 7 1.5 2.5 11,
            `an Oz annexed column` (29.69%) 6 1.5 2 9.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (23.44%) 5 1 1.5 7.5,
            `an Oz annexed column` (20.31%) 4 1 1.5 6.5

-- F-oz-founding-annex-g-a: the first column over 55 prints 6 individual
-- hours. Its hours then make 33, against the 32 its own presence prints,
-- the 32 every position of the table is a share of (95.31% is 30.5 of 32),
-- the 5 the table from 50 to 55 prints, and §26(א)'s 5 for תשע"ד less the
-- 4 frontal hours of the age reduction. Read as 5 (convention
-- reading.misprint): a teacher's week is looked up in the table so read,
-- and the printed table stays the data the checks run on.
`the table of annex ב'3 over 55, as read` MEANS
    `the annexed table with its column` `the table of annex ב'3 over 55` 1 `read as` (`an Oz annexed column` (100.00%) 20 5 7 32)

-- The table for a teacher's band; the annex has none under 50.
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed table`
DECIDE `the table of annex ב'3 for` band IS
    CONSIDER band
    WHEN `the Oz band from 50 to 55` THEN JUST `the table of annex ב'3 from 50 to 55`
    WHEN `the Oz band over 55`       THEN JUST `the table of annex ב'3 over 55, as read`
    WHEN `the Oz band under 50`      THEN NOTHING

-- The asterisk under each table: the presence is in hours of 60 minutes
-- (§9(יא), §26(י)), which changes nothing in the length of a teaching
-- period as the Ministry of Education set it.
@ref akn:att_8__hc_1/p3 akn:att_8__hc_1/p5
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz annexed column`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of presence a column of annex ב'3 asks` c IS
    `the minutes of weekly presence` (`the annexed column's week` c)

`the presence in annex ב'3 changes the length of a teaching period` MEANS FALSE

-- The first note: frontal and role hours that are not whole take the
-- individual and support hours of the column nearest to them, and the
-- position is all the hours over the full position's (common: `the week
-- the annexed table gives`, `the position of the week in the annexed
-- table`) — the full position of the teacher's own table, as
-- F-oz-founding-annex-b-a reads "בסיס המשרה".
@ref akn:att_8__hc_1/p6
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`, f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what the tables of annex ב'3 give for` band f IS
    CONSIDER `the table of annex ב'3 for` band
    WHEN JUST t THEN `what the annexed table gives for` t f
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- The second note: a teacher with fewer than 4 frontal hours (with his
-- homeroom and role hours) works frontal hours only, his position his hours
-- over "בסיס המשרה ברפורמה ביישום חלקי בשנת הלימודים תשע"ד". "בפחות מ-4"
-- leaves 4 out; each table's last column is 4. Which base the note means is
-- F-oz-founding-annex-b-a's: the table's own full position.
@ref akn:att_8__hc_1/p7
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the fewest frontal hours annex ב'3 keeps whole for` band IS
    IF band EQUALS `the Oz band over 55` THEN 4 ELSE 4

GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put him in
      f IS A NUMBER @desc frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex ב'3 gives a teacher with` band f IS
    CONSIDER `the table of annex ב'3 for` band
    WHEN JUST t THEN `what the annexed table gives, frontal hours only below` t (`the fewest frontal hours annex ב'3 keeps whole for` band) f
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

§§ `נספח ב'3 -- the checks`

-- Each table opens at the full position and steps down a frontal hour at a
-- time, to the last column the second note keeps whole.
#ASSERT `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the table of annex ב'3 from 50 to 55` AND `the annexed table opens at the full position` `the table of annex ב'3 over 55`
#ASSERT `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the table of annex ב'3 from 50 to 55` AND `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` `the table of annex ב'3 over 55`
#ASSERT `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ב'3 from 50 to 55` EQUALS `the fewest frontal hours annex ב'3 keeps whole for` `the Oz band from 50 to 55`
#ASSERT `the frontal hours of the annexed table's last column` `the table of annex ב'3 over 55` EQUALS `the fewest frontal hours annex ב'3 keeps whole for` `the Oz band over 55`

-- Their arithmetic holds in every cell but the first column over 55 (above),
-- whose hours make 33: its presence prints 32, and its 100% is 32 hours.
-- As read, it holds there too.
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ב'3 from 50 to 55` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ב'3 over 55` EQUALS LIST
    `the cell of` `the table of annex ב'3 over 55` `the presence row` 1 32,
    `the cell of` `the table of annex ב'3 over 55` `the position row` 1 (100.00%)
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the table of annex ב'3 over 55, as read` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the annexed column's week` (at (`the table of annex ב'3 over 55`'s `its columns`) 0) EQUALS `an Oz week of` 20 6 7
#ASSERT `what annex ב'3 gives a teacher with` `the Oz band over 55` 20 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 20 5 7) 1 1)

§§ `נספח ב'3 -- illustrations`

-- From 50 to 55, 21 frontal hours: the second column, 95.59%; over 55, 3
-- frontal hours: frontal hours only, 3 of 32.
#ASSERT `what annex ב'3 gives a teacher with` `the Oz band from 50 to 55` 21 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 21 5 6.5) (95.59%) (95.59%))
#ASSERT `what annex ב'3 gives a teacher with` `the Oz band over 55` 3 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 3 0 0) (3 DIVIDED BY 32) (3 DIVIDED BY 32))
#ASSERT NOT `the presence in annex ב'3 changes the length of a teaching period`
